@DUSKdev is known for his love towards Chasm: The Rift. He has dedicated a lot of time in supporting the game across many years and even created a great compilation of improvements (as well as developed his own ones) for DOSBox so original game could been played by nowadays gamers called Chasm Portable.

@DUSKdev will play review copy of the game and share his opinion with you. Meanwhile, all of you can check out the demo.

